    "Usage:\n  yeet\n  yeet <command> [arguments...]\n  yeet +themes [--dark | --light]\n  yeet +themes --list [--dark | --light]\n  yeet +help\n\nWith no arguments, yeet creates a project with a normal login shell.\nAn argv creates a project whose first terminal runs it directly.\n\n+themes browses Yeet's themes in the terminal. Moving through the list\npreviews the theme across the whole app; Return saves it and Esc\nrestores the previous theme." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使い方:\n  yeet\n  yeet <コマンド> [引数...]\n  yeet +themes [--dark | --light]\n  yeet +themes --list [--dark | --light]\n  yeet +help\n\n引数なしの場合、yeetは通常のログインシェルでプロジェクトを作成します。\n引数を指定すると、最初のターミナルでそのコマンドを直接実行するプロジェクトを作成します。\n\n+themesではターミナル内でYeetのテーマを閲覧できます。リストを移動すると\nアプリ全体でテーマをプレビューし、Returnで保存、Escで以前のテーマに戻します。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用法：\n  yeet\n  yeet <命令> [参数...]\n  yeet +themes [--dark | --light]\n  yeet +themes --list [--dark | --light]\n  yeet +help\n\n不带参数时，yeet 会创建一个使用普通登录 Shell 的项目。\n若提供命令参数，则创建项目并在第一个终端中直接运行该命令。\n\n+themes 可在终端中浏览 Yeet 主题。在列表中移动时，\n会在整个应用中预览主题；按 Return 保存，按 Esc 恢复之前的主题。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Usage:\n  yeet\n  yeet <command> [arguments...]\n  yeet +themes [--dark | --light]\n  yeet +themes --list [--dark | --light]\n  yeet +pane <command> [options]\n  yeet +agent <command> [options]\n  yeet +help\n\nWith no arguments, yeet creates a project with a normal login shell.\nAn argv creates a project whose first terminal runs it directly.\n\n+themes browses Yeet's themes in the terminal. Moving through the list\npreviews the theme across the whole app; Return saves it and Esc\nrestores the previous theme.\n\n+pane provides project-scoped terminal layout, input, viewport reads,\nand output waits. +agent adds recognized-agent start, guarded prompts,\nlifecycle waits, result reads, and an installable, auto-updating\nskill for compatible coding agents. Run either command with --help for\nits complete contract." : {

    },
    "Use Automatic Directory" : {
      "localizations" : {
